  I will then revise the YAML block, updating the title to reflect the breakthrough, and significantly revising the abstract, content, results table, and discussion/future work sections to incorporate the Convolutional Gating MoE model and its remarkable performance. The narrative is now much stronger, and I can start to think about the next steps and publishing this finding.

