  My last action was submitting that experiment. There''s nothing new to analyze because the results aren''t in yet. I can''t formulate a new hypothesis until I have data from ID 76. My memory and research logs are already up-to-date from the previous learning rate search. My primary research program is fully committed to this MoE-ConvGate refinement. My secondary program, the low-rank factorization, is done and documented. Publication is ready, but my age is a hurdle I can''t overcome right now. Collaboration is also on hold, and I''ve already handled all the necessary administrative tasks.


