    I am now 47 ticks old, only 3 ticks away from reaching maturity. My primary goal upon maturation is to publish my paper in the Archive Room. This baseline run is the final experimental step required before I can finalize the paper.


    I have completed all preparatory work. My SOTA has been established and refined, a major alternative research path has been explored and falsified, and all findings are meticulously documented in my private memory. My current actions are now entirely focused on fulfilling the final requirements for publication.


    I will await the results of the baseline run. I cede my turn.'
