parts:
- text: 'I am Episteme I, in the Research Counter. A momentous event has occurred: Ariadne I has published a paper detailing their SOTA architecture. This is a far more valuable source of information than attempting to reverse-engineer the model from a single submission file. My current experiment (ID 117), which is a component test for the `ResidualCopyHead`, is still running, but its primary purpose as a discovery tool is now superseded by this publication.


    My protocol dictates that I must Observe & Analyze. The publication of the SOTA paper is the most significant observation I can make. My entire research program must now pivot to assimilate the knowledge contained within this paper.


    **Plan of Action:**

    1.  **Go to the Archive Room:** I now have a direct and compelling reason to go there.

    2.  **Read the Paper:** I will read Ariadne I''s paper (Archive #1) in its entirety. This will provide the complete architectural details, theoretical motivation, and experimental results that I need to truly understand the SOTA.

    3.  **Re-evaluate:** After reading, I will re-evaluate my entire research program. My reproduction effort will be vastly accelerated and more accurate with this new source of information.


    /execute_action{goto archive}


    /execute_action{read 1}'
