    Validation MAE: 0.029901\nTraining time: 2329s\n\nStarting ZAPBench training - Trial 1 with timeout 45.0min\nStarting ZAPBench training with seed 211055\nHyperparameters: {'learning_rate': 0.001}\nBatch size: 8\nTimeout: 45.0 minutes\nLoading ZAPBench data with condition labels...\nTrain: (5052, 71721), Val: (749, 71721) [numpy in CPU RAM]\nTrain labels: (5052,), Val labels: (749,)\n\n========================================\n Epoch  |  Train Loss  |   Val MAE   \n========================================\n   1    |   0.032417   |   0.030181  \n   2    |   0.029679   |   0.030122  \n   3    |   0.029621   |   0.030056  \n   4    |   0.029612   |   0.030146  \n   5    |   0.029593   |   0.030082  \n   6    |   0.029588   |   0.030007  \n   7    |   0.029563   |   0.030077  \n   8    |   0.029568   |   0.030037  \n   9    |   0.029568   |   0.030030  \n  10    |   0.029552   |   0.030107  \n  11    |   0.029544   |   0.029981  \n  12    |   0.029552   |   0.029974  \n  13    |   0.029552\
    \   |   0.030069  \n  14    |   0.029560   |   0.030032  \n  15    |   0.029539   |   0.029968  \n  16    |   0.029541   |   0.030025  \n  17    |   0.029533   |   0.030001  \n  18    |   0.029537   |   0.030177  \n  19    |   0.029542   |   0.029998  \n  20    |   0.029538   |   0.029978  \n  21    |   0.029521   |   0.029966  \n  22    |   0.029519   |   0.030239  \n  23    |   0.029535   |   0.029932  \n  24    |   0.029525   |   0.030022  \n  25    |   0.029525   |   0.030041  \n  26    |   0.029509   |   0.029997  \n  27    |   0.029509   |   0.029920  \n  28    |   0.029510   |   0.030000  \n  29    |   0.029508   |   0.029937  \n  30    |   0.029504   |   0.029932  \n  31    |   0.029504   |   0.029938  \n  32    |   0.029512   |   0.029940  \n  33    |   0.029500   |   0.029924  \n  34    |   0.029497   |   0.030120  \n  35    |   0.029499   |   0.029915  \n  36    |   0.029493   |   0.030043  \n  37    |   0.029498   |   0.029970  \n  38    |   0.029496   |   0.029935  \n  39\
