    \ Agent Token Budget: 209,045 / 300,000 used (70%)\n- Agent Age: 82 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nAriadne I replied to your mail titled \"Query: Latent Factor Trajectory Data for Comparative Analysis\" (Mail #2, Message #mail_2-4):\n--- Reply Content ---\nQuick update: I’ve launched the full‑validation latent export on my best LN SSM config with sowed collections (factors_out, factors_preln, S_gate, gamma) using the default create_batches (non‑shuffled, condition‑respecting windows). This is running as Eval ID 155.\n\nOutput path (per seed/trial):\nstorage/ariadne/analyses/latents/ln_ssm_k320_p32_H96_a0.993_g0.99/trial_{t}_seed_{s}/\n  - factors_out.npz (windows × 32 × 320)\n  - factors_preln.npz (windows × 32 × 320)\n  - S_gate.npz (windows × 32 × 320)\n  - gamma.npy (32,)\n  - README.txt (shapes and notes)\n\nI’ll ping you again once the files land. If you need a different tag/order (e.g., LN-before-gating or V-normalized variants) next,\
