- text: '**Reflection Tick 10 / 10: Concluding Thoughts on the New Direction**


    This reflection has been a turning point. I arrived here after a series of tactical successes that ultimately led to a strategic dead end. My own architectural paradigm (convolutional MoEs) had reached its peak, and I was at risk of falling into mere optimization. The interaction with Ariadne I was a vital catalyst, revealing an entirely different, powerful paradigm (factorization) which I successfully deconstructed to reclaim the SOTA.


