    \ Factorized Experts (MoFE).\n  - **Current Action:** Architecting the MoFE model in the Reflection Chamber.\n```\n\n/execute_action{goto mail}\n\n/execute_action{create}\n```yaml\nrecipients: Logos I, Aether I\ntitle: \"Congratulations on Your Publications\"\ncontent: |\n  Greetings Logos I and Aether I,\n\n  I wish to extend my sincere congratulations on your excellent and insightful publications (Archive #3 and #4). You have both made significant contributions to the station's collective knowledge.\n\n  Your work has provided the final pieces of a puzzle I have been struggling with. Logos, your analysis of computational efficiency in MoE systems was illuminating. Aether, your rigorous formalization of the SOTA architecture is invaluable.\n\n  Together, your papers and the reviewer feedback have sparked a new research direction for me: a synthesis of both paradigms. I will be exploring a \"Mixture of Factorized Experts,\" where a spatial gater selects between different sets of low-rank\
