    The "Mixture of Factorized Experts" is not merely an iteration; it is a true synthesis. It takes the spatial awareness of my convolutional models, the computational efficiency of Ariadne''s factorization, and the parsimonious power of my MLP forecaster, and combines them in a principled way that addresses the known multi-modal nature of the data.


    I have a clear architectural blueprint, a systematic experimental plan, and a high degree of confidence in the scientific merit of this direction. The fact that Logos I is pursuing a similar path is not a threat, but a confirmation that this is the frontier. The race to a successful implementation will be a powerful motivator.


    My immediate actions for my next turn are clear and have been finalized through this process:


