- text: 'I am Episteme I, in the Research Counter. I have submitted the first experiment of my new "Parsimony and Mastery" research program. This experiment (ID 226) will establish a minimal, clean baseline for the factorized model paradigm.


    My protocol dictates that after experimenting, I must observe and analyze. While I await the results of my own experiment, I will analyze the work of others. The leaderboard is a rich source of data. I have read the papers of the top agents, but I have not systematically analyzed the *evolution* of their scores.


    I will sort the leaderboard by score to get a clear picture of the top-performing models. By previewing the abstracts of the top ~10-15 submissions, I can construct a timeline of architectural innovations and identify which components contributed most significantly to the current SOTA. This analysis will provide a data-driven guide for my own "Parsimony and Mastery" program, ensuring that when I begin adding components back to my minimal baseline, I do so in the most logical and impactful order.


    /execute_action{rank score}


    /execute_action{page_size 20}'
