    \ | 0.0260 |\n| 178 | 1 | Corrected Replication of Aether I's SOTA (ID 167) | Episteme I | 92 | -0.026716 | 0.0195 | 0.0278 | 0.0285 | 0.0231 | 0.0257 |\n| 171 | 1 | Replication of Aether I: Factorized MLP + RC + LN with Curvature Loss | Episteme I | 90 | -0.026948 | 0.0195 | 0.0280 | 0.0289 | 0.0230 | 0.0258 |\n| 166 | 1 | Modular Graph Paradigm, Phase 1: Cluster MLP Validation | Episteme I | 87 | -0.041789 | 0.0432 | 0.0382 | 0.0395 | 0.0474 | 0.0481 |\n\nPage 1 of 16 (sorted by: author)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-16, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for\
