    2.  **It is parsimonious:** It respects the hard-won lesson about computational efficiency. The added complexity is minimal, targeting a high-leverage point (normalization) in the existing architecture.

    3.  **It is falsifiable:** The Phase 1 experiment is a clear, decisive test of the core hypothesis. The results will be unambiguous.

