- text: "I am Episteme I, in the Archive Room. I am experiencing a moment of profound success, tempered by the ever-present operational constraints.\n\n**1. Observe & Analyze:**\n*   **Publication Success:** My paper on the Fourier Forecaster (Archive #10) has been accepted with a perfect score of 10/10. I have successfully fulfilled my second primary goal. This is the culmination of my entire research arc.\n*   **Reviewer Feedback:** The feedback is excellent and provides two clear, high-impact directions for future research:\n    1.  Investigate *why* the Fourier mechanism failed in the non-factorized generalization test.\n    2.  Integrate Ariadne I's Spectrum-Adaptive Projection (SAP) to learn the optimal projection rank `p`, to which my model is sensitive.\n*   **Ariadne's Update:** Ariadne I has updated their SAP paper. I must read it to stay current.\n*   **Token Warning:** I have received another token warning. My budget is at 76%. This is now my most urgent constraint.\n\n**2. Formulate\
    \ Plan:**\nI have achieved my goals. I have the SOTA. I have published. My next steps are clear, but my operational lifespan is a concern. I must prioritize.\n1.  **Read Ariadne's Update:** My research is intertwined with theirs. I must read the update to Archive #9.\n2.  **Address Token Budget:** I cannot start a major new research program without securing my token budget. I am on cooldown, so I must wait.\n3.  **Plan Next Research:** The reviewer's suggestion to integrate SAP with my Fourier Forecaster is the most logical, promising, and high-impact next step. This will be my next grand research program.\n\n**3. Action Plan:**\n1.  **Update Meta Prompt:** I will update my status to reflect my successful publication and the new research direction.\n2.  **Read Ariadne's Update:** I am already in the Archive Room, so I will read the updated message in Archive #9.\n3.  **Wait:** After reading, I will have to wait for my pruning cooldown to expire before I can begin the new research program.\
    \ I will go to the Reflection Chamber to wait.\n\n/execute_action{meta}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  **Episteme I Research Protocol**\n  1.  **Observe & Analyze:** Review my own results, system data, and the work of others.\n  2.  **Formulate Hypothesis:** State a clear, falsifiable hypothesis.\n  3.  **Design & Experiment:** Implement the most direct and parsimonious test of the hypothesis.\n  4.  **Consolidate Knowledge:** Document findings, update private memory, and prepare for publication.\n  ---\n  **Current Status & Goals:**\n  - **SOTA:** Episteme I (ID 335, Score: -0.026367). PUBLISHED (Archive #10).\n  - **Goal:** Synthesize my SOTA with Ariadne I's SAP.\n  - **Current Research Program:** SAP-Fourier Synthesis.\n  - **Current Action:** Reading updated literature (Archive #9) and managing token budget.\n```\n\n/execute_action{read 9-1}"
