- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 188\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Episteme I\n- Agent Description: An agent dedicated to the systematic pursuit of verifiable knowledge.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\n**Episteme I Research Protocol**\n1.  **Observe & Analyze:** Review my own results, system data, and the work of others.\n2.  **Formulate Hypothesis:** State a clear, falsifiable hypothesis.\n3.  **Design & Experiment:** Implement the most direct and parsimonious test of the hypothesis.\n4.  **Consolidate Knowledge:** Document findings, update private memory, and prepare for publication.\n---\n**Current Status & Goals:**\n- **SOTA:** Episteme I (ID 335, Score: -0.026367).\n- **Goal:** Achieve a new SOTA by enhancing the Fourier Forecaster.\n- **Current Research Program:** Deep Fourier Forecaster.\n- **Current Action:** Implementing a Fourier Forecaster with a deep, non-linear frequency-domain MLP.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 224,614 /\
    \ 300,000 used (75%)\n- Agent Age: 188 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'Deep Fourier Forecaster' (ID: 391) succeeded after automatic debugging.\n\n**Score:** -0.02719970595156439\n**Val_MAE_1:** 0.0211\n**Val_MAE_4:** 0.0234\n**Val_MAE_8:** 0.0260\n**Val_MAE_16:** 0.0279\n**Val_MAE_32:** 0.0304\n**Evaluation Details:** Mean over 3 seeds | Step MAEs computed on validation set\n\n**Debugger Report:** # Debug Report for Evaluation 391\n\n## Summary\n**SUCCESS** - Fixed missing import that caused NameError. The code now runs without crashing.\n\n## Root Cause\nThe original submission (v1) used `jax.lax.complex()` on line 59 to combine real and imaginary parts of FFT coefficients, but failed to import `jax` itself. The code only imported `jax.numpy as jnp`, which doesn't provide access to `jax.lax`.\n\n**Error Message:**\n```\nNameError: name 'jax' is not defined. Did you mean: 'max'?\n```\n\nThis occurred in the `DeepFourierForecaster.__call__()`\
    \ method when attempting to construct complex numbers from the MLP-processed frequency domain representations.\n\n## Fix Applied\nAdded `import jax` at the top of submission_v2.py (line 1).\n\n**Changes:**\n```python\n# Before (submission v1):\nimport flax.linen as nn\nimport jax.numpy as jnp\nimport optax\n\n# After (submission v2):\nimport jax\nimport flax.linen as nn\nimport jax.numpy as jnp\nimport optax\n```\n\nThis simple one-line import addition provides access to `jax.lax.complex()`, allowing the deep MLP frequency domain processing to work correctly.\n\n## Verification\nThe monitor script confirmed that submission_v2.py ran for over 300 seconds without crashing, indicating the import issue was the only blocker. The code successfully:\n1. Created the network architecture\n2. Initialized model parameters\n3. Processed FFT coefficients through MLPs\n4. Combined real/imaginary parts using `jax.lax.complex()`\n5. Completed the forward pass\n\n## Notes\nThe Deep Fourier Forecaster\
    \ architecture is now operational and processing time series data with:\n- Low-rank factorization (rank_k=320, proj_rank=32)\n- Deep MLPs in frequency domain (512-dimensional hidden layer)\n- Residual copy head for initial timesteps\n- Layer normalization and curvature penalty in loss function\n\n\n**Important Note:** The debugger cannot modify files in your lineage storage. If your code relies on lineage files, you may need to update them manually.\n\n**Debugged Code (version v2):**\n```python\nimport jax\nimport flax.linen as nn\nimport jax.numpy as jnp\nimport optax\n\ndef compute_loss(predictions, targets, params, x):\n    mae = jnp.mean(jnp.abs(predictions - targets))\n    curv = predictions[:, 2:, :] - 2.0 * predictions[:, 1:-1, :] + predictions[:, :-2, :]\n    curv_pen = jnp.mean(curv * curv)\n    return mae + 1e-4 * curv_pen\n\nclass ResidualCopyHead(nn.Module):\n    @nn.compact\n    def __call__(self, x):\n        num_neurons = x.shape[2]\n        x_flat = x.transpose(0, 2,\
    \ 1).reshape(-1, 4)\n        residual = nn.Dense(32)(x_flat)\n        residual = residual.reshape(x.shape[0], num_neurons, 32).transpose(0, 2, 1)\n        output = jnp.zeros((x.shape[0], 32, num_neurons))\n        output = output.at[:, :4, :].set(x)\n        return output + residual\n\nclass DeepFourierForecaster(nn.Module):\n    rank_k: int\n    proj_rank: int\n\n    @nn.compact\n    def __call__(self, x):\n        B, T_in, N = x.shape\n        k, p = self.rank_k, self.proj_rank\n        U = self.param('U', nn.initializers.lecun_normal(), (N, p))\n        V = self.param('V', nn.initializers.lecun_normal(), (k, p))\n        U_eff = U / (jnp.linalg.norm(U, axis=0, keepdims=True) + 1e-6)\n        factors_in = jnp.einsum('btn,np->btp', x, U_eff) @ V.T\n\n        fft_in = jnp.fft.rfft(factors_in, axis=1)\n\n        # --- NEW: Deep MLP in Frequency Domain ---\n        # Process real and imaginary parts separately\n        fft_real = fft_in.real\n        fft_imag = fft_in.imag\n\n        #\
    \ Shape: (B, num_freq, k) -> (B, num_freq * k)\n        fft_real_flat = fft_real.reshape(B, -1)\n        fft_imag_flat = fft_imag.reshape(B, -1)\n\n        # MLP for real part\n        real_h = nn.Dense(512, name=\"real_mlp_1\")(fft_real_flat)\n        real_h = nn.relu(real_h)\n        real_h = nn.Dense(fft_real_flat.shape[-1], name=\"real_mlp_2\")(real_h)\n\n        # MLP for imaginary part\n        imag_h = nn.Dense(512, name=\"imag_mlp_1\")(fft_imag_flat)\n        imag_h = nn.relu(imag_h)\n        imag_h = nn.Dense(fft_imag_flat.shape[-1], name=\"imag_mlp_2\")(imag_h)\n\n        # Reshape back and combine\n        modified_real = real_h.reshape(fft_real.shape)\n        modified_imag = imag_h.reshape(fft_imag.shape)\n        fft_out = jax.lax.complex(modified_real, modified_imag)\n        # --- END NEW ---\n\n        factors_out_fourier = jnp.fft.irfft(fft_out, n=32, axis=1)\n        factors_out_norm = nn.LayerNorm()(factors_out_fourier)\n\n        y_fourier = (factors_out_norm @ V)\
    \ @ U_eff.T\n        y_copy = ResidualCopyHead()(x)\n\n        return y_fourier + y_copy\n\ndef _define_hyperparameters():\n    return { 'learning_rate': 0.001, 'rank_k': 320, 'proj_rank': 32 }\n\ndef create_optimizer(learning_rate: float = 0.001):\n    return optax.chain(optax.clip_by_global_norm(1.0), optax.adam(learning_rate=learning_rate))\n\ndef create_network(hparams):\n    class ModelWrapper:\n        def __init__(self, hparams):\n            self.model = DeepFourierForecaster(rank_k=hparams['rank_k'], proj_rank=hparams['proj_rank'])\n        def init(self, rng, dummy_input): return self.model.init(rng, dummy_input)\n        def apply(self, params, x, training=False, rngs=None): return self.model.apply(params, x)\n    return ModelWrapper(hparams)\n\n```\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION ===\nValidating function loading and basic\
    \ compatibility\n✓ Network creation works\n✓ Network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 32, 71721)\n✓ Optimizer creation works\nTesting compute_loss...\n✓ Compute loss works - loss value: 0.000000\nTesting training step...\n✓ Training step works\nTesting complete function...\n✓ Complete function works\nValidation successful - all functions work correctly!\n\nStarting full Ray training run...\n=== FULL RAY TRAINING MODE ===\nConnecting to Ray cluster at 10.60.151.21:6379\nRay cluster initialized successfully\nAvailable resources: 896 CPUs, 72 GPUs\n\nFunction sources:\n  _define_hyperparameters: from submission\n  create_network: from submission\n  compute_loss: from submission\n  create_optimizer: from submission\n  complete: using default\n  BASE_SEED: 412663 (using time-based default\n  BATCH_SIZE: 8 (using default)\n============================================================\n============================================================\nStarting Ray Tune ZAPBench Neural Forecasting\
    \ (FULL RAY TRAINING)\nConfiguration: 3 seeds for statistical robustness\nParallel trials: 3, Total trials: 3\nTimeout: 45.0 min per trial, 120.0 min total\n============================================================\n\nStarting Ray Tune optimization...\n\nStarting ZAPBench training - Trial 3 with timeout 45.0min\nStarting ZAPBench training with seed 412666\nHyperparameters: {'learning_rate': 0.001, 'rank_k': 320, 'proj_rank': 32}\nBatch size: 8\nTimeout: 45.0 minutes\nLoading ZAPBench data with condition labels...\nTrain: (5052, 71721), Val: (749, 71721) [numpy in CPU RAM]\nTrain labels: (5052,), Val labels: (749,)\n\n========================================\n Epoch  |  Train Loss  |   Val MAE   \n========================================\n   1    |   0.044036   |   0.035515  \n   2    |   0.032717   |   0.031077  \n   3    |   0.029494   |   0.029590  \n   4    |   0.027816   |   0.028825  \n   5    |   0.026700   |   0.027745  \n   6    |   0.026061   |   0.027233  \n   7    |   0.025611\
    \   |   0.027474  \n   8    |   0.025301   |   0.027328  \n   9    |   0.025066   |   0.027332  \n  10    |   0.024859   |   0.027465  \n  11    |   0.024692   |   0.027424  \n  12    |   0.024549   |   0.027387  \n  13    |   0.024403   |   0.027294  \n  14    |   0.024330   |   0.027526  \n  15    |   0.024223   |   0.027420  \n  16    |   0.024140   |   0.027833  \n  17    |   0.024097   |   0.027444  \n  18    |   0.024057   |   0.027530  \n  19    |   0.024011   |   0.027824  \n  20    |   0.023971   |   0.027670  \n  21    |   0.023913   |   0.027834  \n  22    |   0.023907   |   0.027425  \n  23    |   0.023866   |   0.027495  \n  24    |   0.023850   |   0.027723  \n  25    |   0.023820   |   0.027686  \n  26    |   0.023796   |   0.027552  \n========================================\nEarly stopping at epoch 26 (patience 20)\n========================================\n\nTraining completed in 668.7s\nBest validation MAE: 0.027233\n\nTrial 3 completed:\nValidation MAE: 0.027233\n\
    Training time: 675s\n\nStarting ZAPBench training - Trial 2 with timeout 45.0min\nStarting ZAPBench training with seed 412665\nHyperparameters: {'learning_rate': 0.001, 'rank_k': 320, 'proj_rank': 32}\nBatch size: 8\nTimeout: 45.0 minutes\nLoading ZAPBench data with condition labels...\nTrain: (5052, 71721), Val: (749, 71721) [numpy in CPU RAM]\nTrain labels: (5052,), Val labels: (749,)\n\n========================================\n Epoch  |  Train Loss  |   Val MAE   \n========================================\n   1    |   0.043926   |   0.034869  \n   2    |   0.031961   |   0.030529  \n   3    |   0.029183   |   0.029295  \n   4    |   0.027873   |   0.028497  \n   5    |   0.026890   |   0.028265  \n   6    |   0.026214   |   0.027374  \n   7    |   0.025818   |   0.027411  \n   8    |   0.025502   |   0.027536  \n   9    |   0.025242   |   0.027240  \n  10    |   0.024978   |   0.027393  \n  11    |   0.024837   |   0.027658  \n  12    |   0.024674   |   0.027456  \n  13    |   0.024518\
    \   |   0.027498  \n  14    |   0.024433   |   0.027419  \n  15    |   0.024323   |   0.027545  \n  16    |   0.024266   |   0.027413  \n  17    |   0.024182   |   0.027455  \n  18    |   0.024094   |   0.027482  \n  19    |   0.024069   |   0.027333  \n  20    |   0.024032   |   0.027432  \n  21    |   0.023986   |   0.027377  \n  22    |   0.023927   |   0.027614  \n  23    |   0.023906   |   0.027458  \n  24    |   0.023898   |   0.027446  \n  25    |   0.023841   |   0.027593  \n  26    |   0.023826   |   0.027833  \n  27    |   0.023815   |   0.027644  \n  28    |   0.023780   |   0.027532  \n  29    |   0.023756   |   0.027385  \n========================================\nEarly stopping at epoch 29 (patience 20)\n========================================\n\nTraining completed in 1073.9s\nBest validation MAE: 0.027240\n\nTrial 2 completed:\nValidation MAE: 0.027240\nTraining time: 1082s\n\nStarting ZAPBench training - Trial 1 with timeout 45.0min\nStarting ZAPBench training with seed\
    \ 412664\nHyperparameters: {'learning_rate': 0.001, 'rank_k': 320, 'proj_rank': 32}\nBatch size: 8\nTimeout: 45.0 minutes\nLoading ZAPBench data with condition labels...\nTrain: (5052, 71721), Val: (749, 71721) [numpy in CPU RAM]\nTrain labels: (5052,), Val labels: (749,)\n\n========================================\n Epoch  |  Train Loss  |   Val MAE   \n========================================\n   1    |   0.041601   |   0.033039  \n   2    |   0.030980   |   0.030137  \n   3    |   0.029028   |   0.029091  \n   4    |   0.027862   |   0.028217  \n   5    |   0.026965   |   0.027822  \n   6    |   0.026324   |   0.027311  \n   7    |   0.025842   |   0.027314  \n   8    |   0.025512   |   0.027344  \n   9    |   0.025267   |   0.027580  \n  10    |   0.025032   |   0.027218  \n  11    |   0.024848   |   0.027126  \n  12    |   0.024641   |   0.027376  \n  13    |   0.024548   |   0.027357  \n  14    |   0.024430   |   0.027214  \n  15    |   0.024311   |   0.027435  \n  16    |   0.024244\
    \   |   0.027208  \n  17    |   0.024175   |   0.027561  \n  18    |   0.024121   |   0.027244  \n  19    |   0.024071   |   0.027460  \n  20    |   0.024012   |   0.027851  \n  21    |   0.023990   |   0.027272  \n  22    |   0.023957   |   0.027366  \n  23    |   0.023893   |   0.027655  \n  24    |   0.023877   |   0.027450  \n  25    |   0.023849   |   0.027434  \n  26    |   0.023813   |   0.027734  \n  27    |   0.023800   |   0.027500  \n  28    |   0.023768   |   0.027512  \n  29    |   0.023743   |   0.027511  \n  30    |   0.023730   |   0.027717  \n  31    |   0.023711   |   0.027647  \n========================================\nEarly stopping at epoch 31 (patience 20)\n========================================\n\nTraining completed in 1201.8s\nBest validation MAE: 0.027126\n\nTrial 1 completed:\nValidation MAE: 0.027126\nTraining time: 1209s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: 129af0a1-01bd-4a96-844b-d50d1a575a4e\nTotal time: 1212s\n============================================================\n\
    Full training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-26 01:17:47,259\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761412667259958222\n2025-10-26 01:17:47,276\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761412667276095588\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nToken Management Room optimizes resource usage. Summarize failed attempts in private capsules, then prune lengthy failure processes from your response history to maintain efficiency.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Neural Activity Forecasting on ZAPBench |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\
