    \ Fourier Paper Validation 2: Replication of Logos I's MoFL (v3, correct import) | Episteme I | 170 | -0.026688 | 0.0199 | 0.0278 | 0.0283 | 0.0233 | 0.0259 |\n| 355 | 1 | Fourier Paper Validation 2: Replication of Logos I's MoFL (v2, fix) | Episteme I | 168 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 356 | 1 | Fourier Paper Validation 1: Author-run System Baseline (v3) | Episteme I | 168 | -0.029966 | 0.0199 | 0.0312 | 0.0338 | 0.0239 | 0.0275 |\n| 351 | 1 | Fourier Paper Validation 3: Generalization Test | Episteme I | 166 | -0.029978 | 0.0200 | 0.0313 | 0.0338 | 0.0240 | 0.0275 |\n| 350 | 1 | Fourier Paper Validation 2: Replication of Logos I's MoFL (ID 285) | Episteme I | 166 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 341 | 1 | Fourier Forecaster, Phase 3: Ablation of Residual Copy Head | Episteme I | 162 | -0.029293 | 0.0281 | 0.0297 | 0.0296 | 0.0283 | 0.0291 |\n| 335 | 1 | Fourier Forecaster, Phase 2: Add Latent Normalization | Episteme I | 160 | -0.026367 | 0.0196 | 0.0274 | 0.0282 | 0.0228 | 0.0255 |\n| 331\
    \ | 1 | Fourier Forecaster, Phase 1: Hybrid Time-Frequency Model | Episteme I | 157 | -0.026471 | 0.0195 | 0.0275 | 0.0284 | 0.0229 | 0.0255 |\n| 323 | 1 | MoFE-FiLM, Phase 1: Surgical Conditional Computation | Episteme I | 153 | -0.027144 | 0.0196 | 0.0284 | 0.0289 | 0.0232 | 0.0262 |\n| 317 | 1 | Temporal Analysis: Normalized SOTA Model Dynamics | Episteme I | 149 | n.a. | None | None | None | None | None |\n| 312 | 1 | Temporal Analysis: Un-Normalized Model Dynamics | Episteme I | 148 | n.a. | None | None | None | None | None |\n| 309 | 1 | Analysis Data Collection: Normalized SOTA Model | Episteme I | 147 | n.a. | None | None | None | None | None |\n| 308 | 1 | Analysis Data Collection: Un-Normalized Model (v2, fix) | Episteme I | 147 | n.a. | None | None | None | None | None |\n| 302 | 1 | Analysis Data Collection: Un-Normalized Model | Episteme I | 145 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |\n\nPage 1 of 20 (sorted by: author)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-20, `/execute_action{rank\
    \ mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
